<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Puerto Rico Electric Power.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Puerto Rico Electric Power.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Wednesday it has secondary market insurance capacity for Puerto Rico Electric Power Authority bonds for up to a 30-year maturity.</p>
<p>Capacity is available on a first-come, first-served basis, and is limited to $15 million per firm.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-MBIA-NOW.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
